      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Workqueues",
      "source_hash": 16429096238636618571,
      "context_hash": 8718304969858837772,
      "translation": "Workqueue",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "workqueue": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Process-context deferred work — the right choice for most drivers",
      "source_hash": 8902955325616461672,
      "context_hash": 17212610660914623649,
      "translation": "프로세스 컨텍스트 지연 작업 — 대부분의 드라이버에 알맞은 선택",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "drivers": "드라이버",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What are workqueues?",
      "source_hash": 13213157861660540641,
      "context_hash": 4063504410783818028,
      "translation": "Workqueue란 무엇입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "workqueue": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Workqueues are the most flexible deferred work mechanism in the kernel.",
      "source_hash": 58628072191227553,
      "context_hash": 4997707181514084851,
      "translation": "Workqueue는 커널에서 가장 유연한 지연 작업(deferred work) 메커니즘입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "workqueue": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803646Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Unlike softirqs and tasklets, workqueue handlers run in **process context** — they can sleep, take mutexes, do memory allocation with `GFP_KERNEL`, and perform any operation that's valid in a kernel thread.",
      "source_hash": 6562352709531406039,
      "context_hash": 3300604820688682767,
      "translation": "softirq나 tasklet과 달리 workqueue 핸들러는 **프로세스 컨텍스트**에서 실행됩니다. 따라서 sleep할 수 있고, 뮤텍스를 획득할 수 있으며, `GFP_KERNEL`로 메모리 할당을 할 수 있고, 커널 스레드에서 유효한 모든 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "handler": "핸들러",
        "kernel thread": "커널 스레드",
        "memory allocation": "메모리 할당",
        "mutex": "뮤텍스",
        "softirq": "softirq",
        "tasklet": "tasklet",
        "workqueue": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:27:33.247751Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel automatically manages a pool of worker threads.",
      "source_hash": 17456467868005107366,
      "context_hash": 6502989776529612734,
      "translation": "커널은 워커 스레드 풀을 자동으로 관리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "pool": "풀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803647Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Each work item is queued and run when a worker becomes available.",
      "source_hash": 15989795349300586423,
      "context_hash": 4241171083188143128,
      "translation": "각 작업 항목(work item)은 큐에 들어갔다가 워커가 사용 가능해지면 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803647Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Work items and initialization",
      "source_hash": 11476669343696897319,
      "context_hash": 12370141648916593725,
      "translation": "작업 항목과 초기화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803647Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Scheduling work",
      "source_hash": 11694994622816598164,
      "context_hash": 10540219663072455473,
      "translation": "작업 스케줄링",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803647Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`schedule_work()` is idempotent: if the work is already pending, calling it again does nothing.",
      "source_hash": 15979057273449306255,
      "context_hash": 11918497195698270197,
      "translation": "`schedule_work()`는 멱등적입니다. 작업이 이미 대기 중이면 다시 호출해도 아무 일도 일어나지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803647Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The work will run exactly once.",
      "source_hash": 4551926806819174123,
      "context_hash": 9243183261189762310,
      "translation": "작업은 정확히 한 번 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803647Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "System workqueues",
      "source_hash": 14124006976229659739,
      "context_hash": 2270520472626406085,
      "translation": "시스템 workqueue",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "workqueue": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803648Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel provides several pre-built workqueues for different priorities and behaviors:",
      "source_hash": 8840722499548280989,
      "context_hash": 858989436961544517,
      "translation": "커널은 서로 다른 우선순위와 동작을 위해 미리 만들어진 여러 workqueue를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "workqueue": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803648Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For most drivers, `system_wq` (accessed via `schedule_work()`) is the right choice.",
      "source_hash": 9834795417766423238,
      "context_hash": 6233983442074795844,
      "translation": "대부분의 드라이버에는 `system_wq`(`schedule_work()`를 통해 사용)가 알맞은 선택입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "drivers": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803648Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating a private workqueue",
      "source_hash": 4392577421649730913,
      "context_hash": 688466333111008386,
      "translation": "전용 workqueue 생성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "workqueue": "workqueue"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803648Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For work that needs specific concurrency control or isolation from system work:",
      "source_hash": 13437154764102732879,
      "context_hash": 611027044203820714,
      "translation": "특정한 동시성 제어나 시스템 작업과의 격리가 필요한 작업의 경우는 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:23.803648Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
